{"title":"2020 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(🚀Very_Fast🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (🚀Very Fast🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_STEMbreezy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by STEMbreezy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Ricardo has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/509a9369d5c55fd98dc99cb2938fb44f0101f90a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2020$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> coins, some of which are pennies (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-cent coins) and the rest of which are nickels (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-cent coins). He has at least one penny and at least one nickel. What is the difference in cents between the greatest possible and least amounts of money that Ricardo can have?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/e/45e9b33f76d6e816195aa7f691a04a9c14523559.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\text{806} \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\text{8068} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\text{8072} \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\text{8076}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\text{8082}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"467\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Clearly, the amount of money Ricardo has will be maximized when he has the maximum number of nickels. Since he must have at least one penny, the greatest number of nickels he can have is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/9/f49e1f42131f302f2b4a45393cdc3fed5be2655c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />, giving a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/b/1cb4122319a9b53bbfd7878012936067bf64222c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2019\\cdot 5 + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> cents. Analogously, the amount of money he has will be least when he has the greatest number of pennies; as he must have at least one nickel, the greatest number of pennies he can have is also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/9/f49e1f42131f302f2b4a45393cdc3fed5be2655c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />, giving him a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/1/9c1fc5a5e19645753fe59eff8dd9042fb1f87d79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2019\\cdot 1 + 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"18\" /> cents. Hence the required difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/a/7aad883b32b506008cba937df84f736d314828c0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2019\\cdot 5 + 1)-(2019\\cdot 1 + 5)=2019\\cdot 4-4=4\\cdot 2018=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }8072}\\]\" width=\"479\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose Ricardo has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> pennies, so then he has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/3/0137d03adc886eaf43b1dd42449745daeea59ac1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2020-p)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> nickels. In order to have at least one penny and at least one nickel, we require <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/5/7a51ce59afdd4b396899db46e9ca0f9f3a44c321.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac540cdd70b5d15e9d10b57c0412e500c8f5f29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2020 - p \\geq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"16\" />, i.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/104efa039872cb99b422687e65aef2b80831460e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq p \\leq 2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"17\" />. The number of cents he has is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/c/56c165d57f23b6b8cfe4d5c9fc0457988fa319f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+5(2020-p) = 10100-4p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"233\" height=\"18\" />, so the maximum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/9/bb995fd107b661e2bdebf0229e879de124ab457d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10100-4 \\cdot 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"98\" height=\"13\" /> and the minimum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/3/fd3bc45d29d54b6a9dc5f95f7890d77fe7388aec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10100 - 4 \\cdot 2019$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"125\" height=\"13\" />, and the difference is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/6/68604d817623e85842cbf1a05bab0254725f67d3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(10100 - 4\\cdot 1) - (10100 - 4\\cdot 2019) = 4\\cdot 2019 - 4 = 4\\cdot 2018 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }8072}\\]\" width=\"514\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_.28Easy_to_understand.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_NiuniuMaths_(Easy_to_understand!)\">Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by NiuniuMaths (Easy to understand!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hgK6rESdek&amp;t=9s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hgK6rESdek&amp;t=9s</a>\n</p><p>~NiuniuMaths\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=5OsfZIo0eURrtNri&amp;t=845\">https://youtu.be/UnVo6jZ3Wnk?si=5OsfZIo0eURrtNri&amp;t=845</a> \n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28.F0.9F.9A.80Very_Fast.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(🚀Very_Fast🚀)\">Video Solution (🚀Very Fast🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (🚀Very Fast🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SkEGB5NSjxU\">https://youtu.be/SkEGB5NSjxU</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_North_America_Math_Contest_Go_Go_Go\">Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by North America Math Contest Go Go Go\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w4S6K9XbHJg\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=w4S6K9XbHJg</a>\n</p><p>~North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/OWNZBPIzQXQ\">https://youtu.be/OWNZBPIzQXQ</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/61c1MR9tne8\">https://youtu.be/61c1MR9tne8</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Interstigation\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=300\">https://youtu.be/YnwkBZTv5Fw?t=300</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_STEMbreezy\">Video Solution by STEMbreezy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by STEMbreezy\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/U27z1hwMXKY?list=PLFcinOE4FNL0TkI-_yKVEYyA_QCS9mBNS&amp;t=181\">https://youtu.be/U27z1hwMXKY?list=PLFcinOE4FNL0TkI-_yKVEYyA_QCS9mBNS&amp;t=181</a>\n</p><p>~STEMbreezy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution_by_TheNeuralMathAcademy\">Video solution by TheNeuralMathAcademy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><sp